File-level provenance map:

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/Internal/DiagramModel.swift
    Adapted from grok-mermaid src/graph.ts and src/types.ts.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/Internal/DiagramParser.swift
    Adapted from grok-mermaid src/parse.ts and src/labels.ts. The XY parser is
    an independent Swift implementation based on the public Mermaid syntax.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/Internal/DiagramLayout.swift
    Adapted in concepts and glyph vocabulary from grok-mermaid src/layout.ts,
    src/layout-seq.ts, and src/canvas.ts. Its direction-aware topology routes,
    folded and full sequence lifelines, constrained entity geometry, dense XY
    aggregation, and allocation-time cell budgets are substantial
    Swift-specific changes.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/UnicodeWidth.swift
    Cluster-width behavior adapted from grok-mermaid src/width.ts. Swift
    Character supplies extended-grapheme segmentation in place of
    Intl.Segmenter.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/Generated/UnicodeWidthData.swift and Tools/width-oracle
    Generated from the same pinned unicode-width 0.2.0 oracle used by
    grok-mermaid src/width-data.ts, extended with the crate's CJK widths for
    SwiftMermaid's explicit ambiguous-width policy.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/Generated/UnicodeBidiData.swift
    Generated from Unicode 15.1.0 DerivedBidiClass.txt. It contains exact
    Bidi_Class R and AL membership runs used only to diagnose logical-order
    right-to-left rendering.

  Sources/SwiftMermaid/MermaidSurface.swift
    Structured cell and semantic-role concepts adapted from grok-mermaid
    src/canvas.ts and src/types.ts. Continuation cells, package validation, and
    host sizing negotiation are Swift-specific extensions.

  Tests/SwiftMermaidTests/Fixtures and family/Unicode tests
    Test categories and small source shapes were informed by grok-mermaid's
    Apache-licensed corpus; assertions target SwiftMermaid's distinct public
    interface and output contract.

